# twist_cyclic_of_psi_trivial  (item (5) at new ramification)

**Statement.** Suppose `D_A ≤ G_K`, `ψ` is trivial on `D_A`, and `x` satisfies Theorem 13's cyclicity
clause at `A` (`U = V ⊓ D_A` normal in `D_A`, `D_A/U` generated by `g`, `x` a coboundary on `U`). Then the
twisted solution has cyclic local group at `A`.

**Proof.**
1. `restrict K` is trivial on `D_A`, so `x` is additive on `D_A` and the coboundary on `U` is 0.
2. For `δ = g^m u`: `x δ = m • x g`, and `flowTwistEHom δ = gradeInl (x δ) · ψ δ = gradeInl (x g)^m`.
3. So the image is `zpowers (twist g)`; use `isCyclic_iff_exists_zpowers_eq_top` on the mapped subgroup.

Theorem 13's last conjunct is exactly `hcyc` (for `B ∉ S`-conjugates). Together with
`step4_transport_of_sha13_psi`, this gives Step4Input item (5) at every place outside `S`-conjugates.

**Imports.** `scholz_succ_of_properStage`. **Size.** Small.
-/

namespace Work.SSGRoute

open SSGRoute
open Work.CohomologicalShrinking

/-- **Cyclicity of the local group of the twist at a place where the lift is trivial.**

At a place `A` with `D_A ≤ G_K` (so `restrict K` is trivial on `D_A`) and `ψ` trivial on `D_A`,
if the cocycle `x` is additive on `D_A` and is a coboundary on a subgroup `U ≤ D_A` with
`D_A/U` generated by the image of `g`, then the local group of the twist is cyclic, generated by
the image of `g`.

This is the "additivity on the decomposition group" half of Step 4 of Schmidt–Wingberg: it uses
only that `x` is a cocycle for the `Gal(K/ℚ)`-action, which is trivial on `D_A`. -/
theorem twist_cyclic_of_psi_trivial (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime]
    (K : IntermediateField ℚ SSGRoute.QBar) [FiniteDimensional ℚ K] [Normal ℚ K] (n i j : ℕ)
    (x : SSGRoute.GalQ → E p (K ≃ₐ[ℚ] K) n i j)
    (ψ : SSGRoute.GalQ →* flowGroup p (K ≃ₐ[ℚ] K) n (tauSucc i j).1 (tauSucc i j).2)
    (hψquot : ∀ σ, flowQuot p (K ≃ₐ[ℚ] K) n (tauSucc i j).1 (tauSucc i j).2 (ψ σ) =
      Work.SSGRoute.restrict K σ)
    (hxmul : ∀ σ τ : SSGRoute.GalQ, x (σ * τ) = x σ + (Work.SSGRoute.restrict K σ) • x τ)
    (A : ValuationSubring SSGRoute.QBar)
    (hDK : ∀ σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A, σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup)
    (hψA : ∀ σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A, ψ σ = 1)
    (hcyc : ∃ U : Subgroup SSGRoute.GalQ,
      (∃ V : Subgroup SSGRoute.GalQ, IsOpen (V : Set SSGRoute.GalQ) ∧
        U = V ⊓ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A) ∧
      (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A, ∀ u ∈ U, δ * u * δ⁻¹ ∈ U) ∧
      (∃ g ∈ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A, ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A, ∃ m : ℤ, δ⁻¹ * g ^ m ∈ U) ∧
      SSGRoute.IsCoboundaryOn (Work.SSGRoute.restrict K) U x) :
    IsCyclic ((SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A).map
      (Work.SSGRoute.flowTwistEHom p K n i j x ψ hψquot hxmul)) := by
  obtain ⟨U, ⟨V, hVopen, hUeq⟩, hUnorm, hgen, hxU⟩ := hcyc
  -- `U ≤ D_A`, because `U = V ⊓ D_A`.
  have hUle : U ≤ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A := by
    rw [hUeq]; exact inf_le_right
  -- `restrict K` is trivial on `D_A`.
  have hres1 : ∀ σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A, Work.SSGRoute.restrict K σ = 1 := fun σ hσ =>
    restrict_eq_one_of_mem_fixingSubgroup K (hDK σ hσ)
  -- the coboundary vanishes on `U`.
  have hxU0 : ∀ σ ∈ U, x σ = 0 := fun σ hσ =>
    eq_zero_of_isCoboundaryOn p K n i j hxU σ hσ (hDK σ (hUle hσ))
  -- `D_A/U` is generated by the image of `g`.
  obtain ⟨g, hg, hgcyc⟩ := hgen
  -- Every element of `D_A` has its twist equal to a power of the twist of `g`.
  have hval : ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp ℚ A, ∃ k : ℤ,
      flowTwistEHom p K n i j x ψ hψquot hxmul δ =
        (flowTwistEHom p K n i j x ψ hψquot hxmul g) ^ k := by
    intro δ hδ
    obtain ⟨k, hk⟩ := hgcyc δ hδ
    have hδeq : δ = g ^ k * (δ⁻¹ * g ^ k)⁻¹ := by group
    -- the twist kills `U` (the coboundary vanishes there and `ψ` is trivial there).
    have htw1 : flowTwistEHom p K n i j x ψ hψquot hxmul ((δ⁻¹ * g ^ k)⁻¹) = 1 := by
      have hx0 : x ((δ⁻¹ * g ^ k)⁻¹) = 0 := hxU0 _ (Subgroup.inv_mem _ hk)
      have hψ1 : ψ ((δ⁻¹ * g ^ k)⁻¹) = 1 := by
        rw [map_inv, hψA _ (hUle hk), inv_one]
      rw [flowTwistEHom_apply, flowTwistE, flowTwist, hx0, hψ1]
      simp
    exact ⟨k, by rw [hδeq, map_mul, map_zpow, htw1, mul_one]⟩
  refine (Subgroup.isCyclic_iff_exists_zpowers_eq_top _).mpr
    ⟨flowTwistEHom p K n i j x ψ hψquot hxmul g, le_antisymm ?_ ?_⟩
  · exact Subgroup.zpowers_le.mpr ⟨g, hg, rfl⟩
  · rintro y ⟨δ, hδ, rfl⟩
    obtain ⟨k, hk⟩ := hval δ hδ
    exact Subgroup.mem_zpowers_iff.mpr ⟨k, hk.symm⟩

end Work.SSGRoute
